# PC card pc-team-fitted (BENCH-254): the pilot, fit against master (aa) on the six fitted teams, 4 seeds from 22500, 12 rounds. Template: the card's prep writes the work copy with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml.
--team
true
--seeds
4
--seed-base
22500
--rounds
12
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
plans/team-fitted-set.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@fit.jar
--robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@fit
--member
hadur117.Hadur
--out
work/team-fitted-@V@-pfit
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-fitted-pfit.md
--baseline
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@aa
